<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, we would be as Abel, fully contacting You;</l><l>Not by knowledge or concept, but by life fresh and new.</l><l>Just as Enosh began to call upon Your name,</l><l>And as Enoch who walked with You, we’ll do just the same.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Keep us living and walking as did old Abraham;</l><l>In Your holy appearing to be transfused like him.</l><l>As did Isaac and Jacob, Moses lived this way—</l><l>So dependent upon Your presence with him each day.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Full enjoyment had David, ate the life-giving tree.</l><l>Daniel prayed to his God and lived by Him constantly.</l><l>Jesus lived by the Father to be life complete;</l><l>Now as His living Body of the life tree we’ll eat.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
